        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Market Targeting - 目标市场</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #8d70d0;\n      color: #222;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 496px;\n      min-height: 677px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 7px 10px 18px;\n      background: #fff;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #60449b;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 39px;\n      line-height: 1.18;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 2px 0 23px;\n      font-size: 40px;\n      line-height: 1.05;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: 7px;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.62;\n    }\n\n    .section {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 4px;\n      padding-left: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .section::before {\n      content: \"•\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: -1px;\n      color: #5c5c5c;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .question {\n      margin-right: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .question-mark {\n      color: #d70018;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .level-one {\n      margin: 1px 0 2px 21px;\n      padding: 0;\n      list-style-position: outside;\n    }\n\n    .level-one > li {\n      padding-left: 1px;\n      margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .strategies {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 1px 0 3px 22px;\n      padding-left: 19px;\n      border-left: 1px solid #e4e4e4;\n    }\n\n    .strategy {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 2px;\n      padding-left: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .strategy::before {\n      content: \"•\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      top: -1px;\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .strategy-title {\n      color: #6d54c2;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .details {\n      margin: 2px 0 3px 3px;\n      padding: 0 0 0 20px;\n      border-left: 1px solid #e8e8e8;\n      list-style-position: outside;\n    }\n\n    .details li {\n      margin: 0 0 2px 14px;\n      padding-left: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .details li::marker,\n    .level-one li::marker {\n      color: #666;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .continuation {\n      display: block;\n      padding-left: 1em;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-section {\n      margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 540px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 3.8vw;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        width: 100%;\n        min-height: calc(100vh - 7.6vw);\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [[\"$\", \"$\"]],\n        displayMath: [[\"$$\", \"$$\"]]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Market Targeting</h1>\n      <h2>目标市场</h2>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <span class=\"question\">What</span><span class=\"question-mark\">?</span>\n        <ul class=\"level-one\">\n          <li>明确企业应为哪一类用户服务，满足他们的哪一种需求</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <span class=\"question\">How</span><span class=\"question-mark\">?</span> 三种策略\n\n        <div class=\"strategies\">\n          <div class=\"strategy\">\n            <div class=\"strategy-title\">无差别性市场策略</div>\n            <ul class=\"details\">\n              <li>阐释：把整个市场作为自己的目标市场，只考虑共性，吸引尽可能多的消费者。可口可乐</li>\n              <li>优点：产品单一，可以保证质量，大批量生产，降低生产和销售成本</li>\n              <li>劣势：当同类竞争者也采取相同的策略，就会形成激烈竞争</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"strategy\">\n            <div class=\"strategy-title\">差别性市场策略</div>\n            <ul class=\"details\">\n              <li>阐释：把整个市场细分为若干子市场，针对不同的子市场，设计不同的产品，制定不同的营销策略，满足不同的消费需求。</li>\n              <li>优势：在产品设计或宣传推销上能有的放矢，分别满足不同地区消费者的需求，可增加产品的总销售量，同时可使公司在细分市场上占有优势</li>\n              <li>劣势：由于产品差异化、促销方式差异化，增加了管理难度，提高了生产和销售费用</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"strategy\">\n            <div class=\"strategy-title\">集中性市场策略</div>\n            <ul class=\"details\">\n              <li>在细分后的市场上，选择一个或少数几个细分市场作为目标市场，实行专业化生产和销售</li>\n              <li>优势：集中优势力量，有利于产品适销对路，降低成本，提高企业和产品的知名度</li>\n              <li>劣势：因其目标市场范围小，品种单一，具有较大的经营风险</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section bottom-section\">\n        <span class=\"question\">How</span><span class=\"question-mark\">?</span> 影响因素\n        <ul class=\"level-one\">\n          <li>企业规模和原料的供应、产品类似性、市场类似性、产品生命周期、竞争的目标市场</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
